SUMMARY:Warm Echos
DESCRIPTION:A collection of short films celebrating human connection\, simple and gentle stories that leave a warm and lasting feeling. Catfish: As Elise moves into a new apartment with her parents\, her pet cat Roger turns into a goldfish. Distraught\, she goes back to her childhood home to turn him back. Luce and the Rock: A gentle\, slow-paced tale about curiosity and fear. Through minimal visuals and little dialogue\, the film shows how openness and trust can help us accept others.
